{"4314470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Despair Beneath the Sunless Sky", "steam_appid": 4314470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4766710], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Despair Beneath The Sunless Sky</strong> is a dark fantasy open-world RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the chosen one. You are just another victim trying to survive in a hostile and grotesque world... a world that hides things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows what lies beyond the sky looking down at you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314470/extras/9c990c76d02bea9f9848a1737943b050.avif?t=1786085825\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Open World </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world with complete freedom from the very beginning. There are no limits, only places where your preparation will decide whether you live or die. In addition to multiple spontaneous events and various locations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314470/extras/bd0fed53c114ad5ef3ae48764d98c9d8.avif?t=1786085825\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314470/extras/7fe15814d0910f5aceb418df2f5d5165.pos